{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9671b9417680341d01f7a48f2228563d12c8d86d4b49e00d75bfae407e960c81", "ja": "（真の新しい衣装が届いた。騎士をモチーフにした\nデザインで、劇中で特別任務を行う際に真が着る）", "zh": "（真新的服装送到了。这是一套以骑士为主题的设计，真会在剧中执行特殊任务时穿上它）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "5bb87c71fab94fd83e1867a4f1e9240bf29ed51e7a2e3c4304ffefdede38fc8c", "ja": "スタイリッシュで、カッコいい衣装ですね。\nどうですか？　ボク、ちゃんと強そうに見えます？", "zh": "这套服装既时尚又帅气呢。\n怎么样？我看起来是不是很有实力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3f02fd603efb85d61ea1de7488499fdd5995f1321d8013db3f761f5172d3470b", "ja": "見えるよ！　凛々しくてカッコよくて、\nそれでいて美しさがあるな。", "zh": "当然像！英姿飒爽又帅气，而且还透着一股美感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "0de8dad168a3fabc2f920c75579f07ba5de99eb9aaa5934c9f15c6363f2f3778", "ja": "え？　今の……聞き間違いじゃないですよね？\nその、う……美しさって。", "zh": "诶？刚才那句……不是我听错了吧？\n那个，呃……你说的“美”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bad9f9614bb6188a66a1e92f539abac64228053d6b69433758597bb50daadb25", "ja": "間違いじゃないよ。\n大げさじゃなくて、本当にそう感じたんだ。", "zh": "不是弄错了。\n不是夸张，我真的就是这么觉得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c1f9e79212a0f8548a1e30e4ef0f9fa0260ff239d4e4be72e354f3b0e9f442b5", "ja": "真の持つ雰囲気とか、衣装の華やかさと合わさって……\n思わず、見惚れちゃったよ。", "zh": "和真所散发的气质，以及服装的华丽结合在一起……\n让我不由得看入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "703ca0209e78ee701ae3782e9a2bbfe62fd27e464840cfe2c4d6728531d21c1a", "ja": "……！　そ、そうですか……。\n{$P$}が見惚れるくらい……えへへ。", "zh": "……！　是、是吗……\n能让{$P$}都看得入迷……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "3c598900785e6d26164fcef0095d32d1eb18d22e56c80c2958438d939a4225ce", "ja": "その、「カッコいい」って言ってくれるかなとは、\n密かに期待してたんですけど。", "zh": "其实，我也偷偷期待过，你会不会说一句“帅气”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "2c9ff21a32fa5d00263d535f80c537a14ba6a26cf9916d3e10f2f9ae84df64a0", "ja": "そんな言葉で褒めてもらえるなんて、思わなくて……\nだから、ビックリしちゃいました。", "zh": "没想到你会用那样的话夸我……所以，我真的吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d45e7d84f83e7de744a5e5bcf1524c7a3d925b695a6242b4a6c233029e0e9225", "ja": "そうか、それでちょっと\n珍しい反応だったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，难怪你的反应有点不寻常。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "2122c7dec5ba3640e6921b74260c53284e8ea6a77d9c79d2436ae94782208e7f", "ja": "あはは。自分で言うのもなんですけど……\nこの衣装は、ボクにピッタリだなと思ってて。", "zh": "啊哈哈。虽然由我自己说有点不好意思……\n但我觉得，这身服装真的很适合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "544f586d6131c498522c983bef6c23157f2df0af2fbf9b787e46e9dcc9f3a63e", "ja": "でも「美しさ」って言われるのは、なんだか新鮮で。\n……あの、{$P$}！", "zh": "不过，被人说“美丽”，总觉得很新鲜。\n……那个，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "4bdf532ee886089f3fd1253e20c25a85ebf3de1a5525dafed1f21a01d2b6661a", "ja": "よかったら、もうすこし\n感想を聞かせてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "可以的话，能再跟我多说一点\n你的感想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d4c41aec0586927b36b55f08922da0a830e28c55dc1e209cd0ef488fb867d851", "ja": "ああ、任せろ！\nもう少しどころか、何時間でも語れるぞ！", "zh": "啊，交给我吧！\n别说多说一点了，就算讲上几个小时都没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "01cc4aed5484de109320e04a8ebfb226b122628aaa37554ab8b01fd052261005", "ja": "な、何時間～！？　そんなに褒められたら、ボク……\n恥ずかしくて死んじゃいますよっ！", "zh": "什、几个小时～！？要是被夸成这样，我……\n会害羞死的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ffd080e24d7a12d1392c53462f273eaa0e068062752c54a7d435d97bbe8123d2", "ja": "そこまで？", "zh": "有那么夸张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "c7ab2d432ea4ef866143e01b9c67e0bdfaa72e70a49b8c00ae144c00f6f97ba2", "ja": "はい！　ボクにとって、\n{$P$}の言葉は特別ですから！", "zh": "是的！因为对我来说，{$P$}先生的话语是特别的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "0c282927c840d028ef666c794f78b0758e9d1c1cf53facada9942811627bf067", "ja": "今までだって、ボクが気づいていないボクの魅力を、\nどんどん見つけてくれて……。", "zh": "一直以来，您都不断发掘出连我自己都没察觉到的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "9c81717edd777c468aa2a4be4891c59338793fe563955f2051b74fb37c7d0a98", "ja": "それが、ボクの自信に繋がっているんです！　今だって\nそうですよ？　美しいなんて、思いもよらなかったし。", "zh": "那也让我越来越有自信了！现在也是哦？我从没想过自己居然会被说美丽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dc5dbb3df46a2e6a04de33fc1f0fb4b6866c398995ef758fda08a8b00679cba4", "ja": "そこまで喜んでもらえるとは思わなかったよ。\n思った事を言ったまでだから。", "zh": "没想到你会这么开心。\n我只是把心里想的说出来而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "652fc92d550a667c1643806f459643081863b355976d5373131641c47a65a37f", "ja": "だから、いいんですよ！　本心だって思ったから……\nボクも、うれしかったですし。", "zh": "所以，没关系的！因为我觉得那是真心话……而且我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0584_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "d4df5dfdddafaab2f0b1cbbf78c43d51b1e9c8dff16ccb4deb0b8d92c6e5abf1", "ja": "「美しい」って言葉が似合うアイドルになれてるの\nかもって、自己肯定感バリバリですよ！　へへっ♪", "zh": "我可能已经成为了适合用“美丽”这个词来形容的偶像，感觉自我肯定感满满！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
